WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.181
Every objection to the evidence on this site has been answered — not with opinion, but with the government's own data.

00:00:06.181 --> 00:00:07.454
Ten objections.

00:00:07.454 --> 00:00:08.693
Ten rebuttals.

00:00:08.693 --> 00:00:10.125
Every number sourced.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:12.125
They chose MAID voluntarily.

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:15.568
Sixty-three percent of Track 1 recipients have cancer.

00:00:15.568 --> 00:00:21.874
But Track 2 — the non-dying track — killed seven hundred and thirty-two people in 2024 alone.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:25.545
Forty-seven percent cited loneliness as a source of suffering.

00:00:25.545 --> 00:00:28.693
Forty-nine percent felt they were a burden on their families.

00:00:28.693 --> 00:00:33.830
One hundred and forty-nine people who could have received disability support... chose death instead.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.079
Poverty coercion.

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:40.988
People from the poorest income quintile are two point four two times overrepresented in MAID deaths.

00:00:40.988 --> 00:00:45.454
The correlation between poverty and state-administered death is not a coincidence.

00:00:45.454 --> 00:00:47.193
It is a policy outcome.

00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:49.034
The institutional channels work.

00:00:49.034 --> 00:00:54.806
Five hundred and seventeen confirmed public outcomes in the 504 Documentary prove they do not.

00:00:54.806 --> 00:00:58.377
Zero remedies ordered under the PSDPA in eighteen years.

00:00:58.377 --> 00:01:03.499
CFNIS independence disputed by the Military Police Complaints Commission in formal findings.

00:01:03.499 --> 00:01:07.056
The channels exist to absorb complaints — not to resolve them.

00:01:07.056 --> 00:01:10.374
Every objection on this page links to its government source.

00:01:10.374 --> 00:01:11.636
Read the objection.

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:12.886
Read the rebuttal.

00:01:12.886 --> 00:01:14.715
Verify the data yourself.

00:01:14.715 --> 00:01:18.215
The government's own records are the most damning evidence against them.
